# Patch Code

## Summary
Host command — apply code changes to file and then apply lint fixes. Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import PatchCodeTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/patch-code';

let result = await new PatchCodeTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Apply).
